Adaptations: Electron IPC, React/Zustand state, UI, default external services,
filesystem access and desktop tool catalog are removed. The host injects tool
execution; Rust enforces capability and workspace boundaries. Strict payload
validation, explicit size/step limits, sanitized errors, cancellation and JSONL
transport are maintained by lmBox. The initial adapter supports only compatible
OpenAI Chat Completions. It does not implement the full ConeCode application,
RSI, MCP, sub-agents, desktop automation or vendor-specific providers.

